    return f"""
CRITICAL INSTRUCTION FOR STYLE & VOCABULARY MATCHING:
Analyze the uploaded reference template below and strictly adopt its phrasing, vocabulary, and structural style:
--- UPLOADED TEMPLATE START ---
{extracted_style}
